sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant Agent as LangGraph Agent
    participant Tools as Tool Registry
    participant DS as Data Source API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>FE: Types question in chat
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/chat/message
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT token
    Auth-->>API: User identity confirmed
    API->>DB: Load AI settings + user permissions
    DB-->>API: Settings and allowed modules
    API->>Agent: run_agent(user_id, message, allowed_modules)

    loop Agentic Loop (max iterations)
        Agent->>Tools: LLM selects tool and args
        Tools->>DS: Fetch data (Meta Ads / Shopify / DB / etc.)
        DS-->>Tools: Raw API response
        Tools-->>Agent: Formatted JSON result
        Note over Agent: If HITL signal detected, break loop
    end

    Agent->>DB: Save conversation and assistant message
    Agent-->>API: Response (content, chart_data, pending_action)
    API-->>FE: JSON response
    FE-->>User: Render message + inline chart

    opt HITL action pending
        FE-->>User: Show approval card
        User->>FE: Click Approve
        FE->>API: POST /api/v1/chat/approve/{action_id}
        API->>DS: Execute approved action
        DS-->>API: Confirmation
        API-->>FE: Updated message
        FE-->>User: Action confirmed
    end
